    {
      "id": "claim_42e53771cc4b45c3b0eabb9cc423b52f",
      "statement": "The SSH host renewer is a fixed non-templated unit that gates with step ssh needs-renewal and runs step ssh renew --force on the Ed25519 host key/certificate, then try-reload-or-restarts sshd (noting some distributions name the unit ssh.service).",
